{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"web_search","id":"exec-60d3e18c-0ab7-452d-8e41-b9b6b1c64154","query":"\"Quest for the Rings\" \"manual\" Magnavox ...","action":{"type":"search","queries":["\"Quest for the Rings\" \"manual\" Magnavox","\"Quest for the Rings\" Odyssey2 instructions ringmaster"]},"results":[{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.gamesdatabase.org","ref_id":"turn4search12","snippet":"Quest For The Rings ... (2 players as Heroes, 1 player as Ringmaster.) ... The Ringmaster secretly places the ten Rings at any of the","title":"Seite 1 von 12","url":"https://www.gamesdatabase.org/Media/SYSTEM/Magnavox_Odyssey_2/Manual/formated/The_Quest_for_the_Rings_-_1981_-_Magnavox.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"odyssey2.info","ref_id":"turn4search0","snippet":"#### Computer Intro (Part 2) ... #### Quest for the Rings, The ... The kid's story and word-exercise book included with copies of the game.","title":"Library! - The Odyssey² Homepage!","url":"https://odyssey2.info/library/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"odyssey2.info","ref_id":"turn4search1","snippet":"Quest for the Rings ... RINGMASTER CONTROL = Space","title":"Quest for the Rings! - The Odyssey² Homepage!","url":"https://odyssey2.info/strategy/qrings/"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"odyssey2.info","ref_id":"turn4search2","snippet":"The Story The Heroes The Monsters The Labyrinths The Ringmaster ... The Ringmaster's desire is to possess the ten Rings of Power. ... Two players","title":"The Story of Quest for the Rings - The Odyssey² Homepage!","url":"https://odyssey2.info/reviews/qftr/story.php"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.odyssey2.info","ref_id":"turn4search3","snippet":"Quest for the Rings, The","title":"Quest for the Rings, The Manual | The Odyssey² Homepage Library!","url":"https://www.odyssey2.info/library/library_view.php?i=53"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.pricecharting.com","ref_id":"turn4search4","snippet":"# Quest for the Rings Magnavox Odyssey 2 ... Loos