{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The source’s strongest hook is cooperation: the heroes solve different problems while the Ringmaster controls the route and hazards. I’m building the plan around that, including all four labyrinth types and a dragon encounter won through extraction. The engine and Hub contracts also support a concrete approach: native three-quarter visuals, couch co-op standalone, and online co-op through Hub.\n"}}
